<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for Pounce. Intentionally empty:
  - no App Sandbox (Accessibility/event taps need an unsandboxed process)
  - no Apple Events sending, no JIT, no unsigned library loading
  Accessibility and Screen Recording are TCC grants, not entitlements.
-->
